OL,3,GNEWSAMan seriously injured in
OL,4,Asingle-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man is in a critical condition after
OL,7,Fsuffering serious injuries in a
OL,8,Fsingle-vehicle crash.
OL,10,FSussex Police said it was called to the
OL,11,Fthe A29 Stane Street, in Billingshurst,
OL,12,Fat 17:30 BST on Thursday.
OL,14,FThe injured man, 69, was taken to
OL,15,Fhospital where he remains.
OL,17,FOfficers said they were pursuing
OL,18,Fmultiple lines of enquiry and
OL,19,Fencouraged witnesses or anyone with
OL,20,Frelevant footage to contact the force.
